        "text": "**Selecting Secret Manager**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Secret Manager for the API key retrieval script. This managed secrets store offers a reliable and common solution. I'll focus on its integration with Python next, to prepare the script.\n\n\n**Implementing Python Integration**\n\nI'm now writing the `fetch_api_key.py` script. The goal is to fetch the API key using Google Cloud Secret Manager. I'll include the necessary import statement for the `google.cloud.secretmanager` library. The script will specify the project and secret IDs to retrieve the API key successfully. This will be the foundational component for accessing the secret within the application. I will now start coding the script.\n\n\n",
